# 🛍️ Myntra Sales Analysis Dashboard

## Project Overview

This Power BI dashboard analyzes Myntra sales and order data to understand product, brand, category, discount, and geographic performance.

The dashboard provides an interactive view of sales performance across different years, brands, categories, products, sizes, colors, and locations.

## Key Metrics

- Total Products: 40
- Total Orders: 3,500
- Average Sale Amount: 538.51
- Average Discount: 35.51

## Dashboard Features

- Year-wise sales analysis
- Monthly sales and discount analysis
- Product distribution
- Brand distribution
- Category ranking by sales
- Order distribution
- Color distribution
- Size distribution
- Weekday sales analysis
- Sales-wise order distribution
- City and state-wise order analysis

## Filters

Users can interact with the dashboard using:

- Brands
- Sub-category
- Product Name
- Size
- Category
- Year

## Key Insights

- The dashboard compares sales and average discounts across different months.
- Product and brand distributions help identify popular products and brands.
- Category ranking provides a comparison of sales performance across categories.
- Geographic analysis shows the distribution of orders across cities and states.
- Weekday analysis helps understand sales patterns across different days.
- Size and color distributions provide additional insights into customer product preferences.

## Tools Used

- Power BI
- Power Query
- DAX
- Data Visualization
- Data Analysis
